Measure throughput and load time of downloaded models

Usage: wally bench [OPTIONS] [model]

Arguments:
  model                       Model id, local bundle path, hf.co/... or URL;
                              must already be downloaded (`wally models pull
                              <ref>` first) -- default: all downloaded

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --engine TEXT           Engine hint (mlx, llamacpp, onnx, sherpa)
  -n, --trials INT            Measured trials per scenario (median reported)
      --vlm-image TEXT        Image file for VLM benchmarking (required to
                              benchmark VLM models)
